AU  - Dolmage TE
AD  - Respiratory Diagnostic & Evaluation Services, West Park Healthcare Centre, 
      Toronto, ON, Canada; Respiratory Medicine, West Park Healthcare Centre, Toronto, 
      ON, Canada.
FAU - Janaudis-Ferreira, Tania
