TI  - Diagnosis of adult hereditary pulmonary disease and the role of genetic testing.
PG  - 976-82
LID - 10.1378/chest.09-0281 [doi]
AB  - Genetic testing is becoming a common component of medical practice and is used to 
      determine definitive diagnoses for several adult pulmonary diseases. It is 
      important for pulmonologists to know when to use genetic tests for diagnosis and 
      medical management. This article describes diagnosis of rare hereditary pulmonary 
      disease in adults and the role of genetic testing. A summary on coding and 
      reimbursement is included.
