LID - S0012-3692(12)60121-4 [pii]
LID - 10.1378/chest.11-2294 [doi]
AB  - This article focuses on new antithrombotic drugs that are in or are entering 
      phase 3 clinical testing. Development of these new agents was prompted by the 
      limitations of existing antiplatelet, anticoagulant, or fibrinolytic drugs. 
      Addressing these unmet needs, this article (1) outlines the rationale for 
      development of new antithrombotic agents; (2) describes the new antiplatelet, 
      anticoagulant, and fibrinolytic drugs; and (3) provides clinical perspectives on 
      the opportunities and challenges faced by these novel agents.
