AB  - Pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH) is a fatal orphan disease. The global 
      epidemiology of PAH is not well known and encourages combined national and 
      international efforts to enhance understanding of the disease. A global database 
      will help unify investigators and patients to foster collaboration and knowledge.
