TI  - Vaginal involvement in a patient with sarcoidosis.
PG  - 455-6
LID - 10.1378/chest.09-0076 [doi]
AB  - We report the case of a woman who presented with vaginal symptoms and was proven 
      to have biopsy-confirmed sarcoidosis of the vaginal wall. To our knowledge, this 
      is the first reported case of this entity. An additional unusual finding was that 
      her symptoms of gynecologic sarcoidosis occurred at the time of initial 
      presentation of her pulmonary sarcoidosis.
