TI  - Details and difficulties regarding the new lung cancer staging system.
PG  - 1172-80
LID - 10.1378/chest.09-2626 [doi]
AB  - The new lung cancer stage classification system is the culmination of 10 years of 
      work and an unprecedented analysis and validation process. This article reviews 
      details of the rules governing how to implement the system and discusses areas in 
      which ambiguities and difficulties exist.
